(6058044, 890409, 74979, '<td valign="top">this could be my daugher''s boat!!<br/>ayup..has her name (&amp; last initial too!) on it!<br/>:)</td>', 'this could be my daugher''s boat!!ayup..has her name (& last initial too!) on it!:)', '2010-06-16 01:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058100, 891832, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting street name. Wish I could find that kind of view in Dallas!</td>', 'Interesting street name. Wish I could find that kind of view in Dallas!', '2010-06-16 01:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058110, 891592, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this except for one nitpick. I find the rowboat to be WAY too high in the frame and close to the edge. Otherwise, I really like the details and color treatment.</td>', 'I like this except for one nitpick. I find the rowboat to be WAY too high in the frame and close to the edge. Otherwise, I really like the details and color treatment.', '2010-06-16 01:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058116, 891619, 83313, '<td valign="top">Do I interpret the challenge description narrowly, because there is not boat in the scene? Or do I just accept the relationship to boating? It''s pretty darn cool looking. I''d like to know more about it. Time for a visit to Wikipedia. I think it''s worth a vote on the positive side as a creative take on the topic.</td>', 'Do I interpret the challenge description narrowly, because there is not boat in the scene? Or do I just accept the relationship to boating? It''s pretty darn cool looking. I''d like to know more about it. Time for a visit to Wikipedia. I think it''s worth a vote on the positive side as a creative take on the topic.', '2010-06-16 01:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058128, 891575, 75618, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, very creative take on the challenge. Love the lighting too. 9</td>', 'Hahaha, very creative take on the challenge. Love the lighting too. 9', '2010-06-16 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058129, 890922, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is such an evocative image.  Well processed, like out of a dream.  Loving it.</td>', 'This is such an evocative image.  Well processed, like out of a dream.  Loving it.', '2010-06-16 01:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058132, 891833, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have no freaking idea what I am looking at. It''s a cool abstract, <strike>though it may or may not be a boat.</strike> Ok, duh, it''s a gravy boat! Now I''m arguing with my wife over whether this meets the challenge in a creative OOTB way. Let''s look at the challenge description:<br/><i> <br/>"Big boats, little boats, toy boats, dinghies, sailboats, rowboats, ocean liners, speed boats, cargo ships, cruise ships, <b>etc</b>... take a picture and try to float the voters boat!"</i> <br/> <br/>I say it falls under "Etc."</td>', 'I have no freaking idea what I am looking at. It''s a cool abstract, though it may or may not be a boat. Ok, duh, it''s a gravy boat! Now I''m arguing with my wife over whether this meets the challenge in a creative OOTB way. Let''s look at the challenge description: "Big boats, little boats, toy boats, dinghies, sailboats, rowboats, ocean liners, speed boats, cargo ships, cruise ships, etc... take a picture and try to float the voters boat!"  I say it falls under "Etc."', '2010-06-16 01:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058139, 891575, 96751, '<td valign="top">Too funny.  Love the African Gray - he''s all "what ARE you doing...??"</td>', 'Too funny.  Love the African Gray - he''s all "what ARE you doing...??"', '2010-06-16 01:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058141, 891679, 83313, '<td valign="top">I almost overlooked the person napping on the bench, which explains the choice of title. Great subject, but I''m afraid I find this a fairly plain view of it. Sorry.</td>', 'I almost overlooked the person napping on the bench, which explains the choice of title. Great subject, but I''m afraid I find this a fairly plain view of it. Sorry.', '2010-06-16 01:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058142, 891675, 64929, '<td valign="top">Such an unusual, unique perspective....just have to love it!  Glad you selected to process in B &amp; W - so dramatic!!  *9*</td>', 'Such an unusual, unique perspective....just have to love it!  Glad you selected to process in B & W - so dramatic!!  *9*', '2010-06-16 01:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058143, 891586, 96751, '<td valign="top">You made a LOT more boats than I did...</td>', 'You made a LOT more boats than I did...', '2010-06-16 01:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058145, 890848, 64929, '<td valign="top">Love the processing!</td>', 'Love the processing!', '2010-06-16 01:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058146, 891665, 83313, '<td valign="top">The subject being cut off at the top of the frame really hurts this, I''m afraid. Would have gotten a pretty good vote from me otherwise.</td>', 'The subject being cut off at the top of the frame really hurts this, I''m afraid. Would have gotten a pretty good vote from me otherwise.', '2010-06-16 01:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
