(6058186, 891791, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting.  I can''t tell if this is a night shot or a highly polarized day shot.</td>', 'Fabulous lighting.  I can''t tell if this is a night shot or a highly polarized day shot.', '2010-06-16 01:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
