(6058214, 891602, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset shot, but bottom is too dark and there''s little detail in the boat. The bird atop adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice sunset shot, but bottom is too dark and there''s little detail in the boat. The bird atop adds a nice touch.', '2010-06-16 01:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
