(6058377, 891255, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the subject matter and composition, even though a bit centered. I can see this in Natl Geo. However, I find exposure and color off. Flash is a bit too hot and it looks as though you used a gel to poor effect. The water is a strange yellow green and the sky is of uneven brightness. Also, is that flare in the upper right corner? Most of all, I would have liked more sharpness and detail evident in the boat.</td>', 'I love the subject matter and composition, even though a bit centered. I can see this in Natl Geo. However, I find exposure and color off. Flash is a bit too hot and it looks as though you used a gel to poor effect. The water is a strange yellow green and the sky is of uneven brightness. Also, is that flare in the upper right corner? Most of all, I would have liked more sharpness and detail evident in the boat.', '2010-06-16 03:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
