(6058956, 890560, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fantastic catch. I was going to say you should have tried to clear it up a bit (bring details of the boat out), but that would have removed the mood of the moment.</td>', 'Fantastic catch. I was going to say you should have tried to clear it up a bit (bring details of the boat out), but that would have removed the mood of the moment.', '2010-06-16 11:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
