(6059040, 891255, 28564, '<td valign="top">i like very, very much this shot, even if i do not think that the main subject is the "boat"... however a 7 for me...</td>', 'i like very, very much this shot, even if i do not think that the main subject is the "boat"... however a 7 for me...', '2010-06-16 12:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059096, 890993, 39057, '<td valign="top">I know 3 people on DPC from Louisiana. I am voting on this image w/o know who it is. If you see this comment and I know you, please don''t ID yourself. I don''t want to get banned.<br/> <br/>I had this at a low low score at first. However, I''m moving up a bit. The photo gives the feel that it was taken on a bright bright day and then pulled back to give the look of "depression". However, since the feel is of a bright day, it is kind of a tug o war.</td>', 'I know 3 people on DPC from Louisiana. I am voting on this image w/o know who it is. If you see this comment and I know you, please don''t ID yourself. I don''t want to get banned. I had this at a low low score at first. However, I''m moving up a bit. The photo gives the feel that it was taken on a bright bright day and then pulled back to give the look of "depression". However, since the feel is of a bright day, it is kind of a tug o war.', '2010-06-16 12:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059100, 891674, 39057, '<td valign="top">Too much going on in the photo...trees, docked barges, Tugboat and "red" river water. I have to give a low score.</td>', 'Too much going on in the photo...trees, docked barges, Tugboat and "red" river water. I have to give a low score.', '2010-06-16 12:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059164, 891662, 73575, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the border color - doesn''t pull with the rest of the photo. I''d have gone with black, or matched the dark shadows towards the bottom. Other than that, I really like this.</td>', 'Don''t like the border color - doesn''t pull with the rest of the photo. I''d have gone with black, or matched the dark shadows towards the bottom. Other than that, I really like this.', '2010-06-16 13:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059166, 891285, 73575, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this was difficult to pull off :) Love the idea, but the lighting just doesn''t cut it, especially for advanced editing.</td>', 'I''m sure this was difficult to pull off :) Love the idea, but the lighting just doesn''t cut it, especially for advanced editing.', '2010-06-16 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059170, 891592, 73575, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you were cropping distractions off the top - can still see reflections. Puts the boat too close to the top though. I really like the textures in this photo; the gravel at the bottom really complements the ripples at the top. Wish you could have framed it better...</td>', 'I''m sure you were cropping distractions off the top - can still see reflections. Puts the boat too close to the top though. I really like the textures in this photo; the gravel at the bottom really complements the ripples at the top. Wish you could have framed it better...', '2010-06-16 13:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059175, 891653, 73575, '<td valign="top">Or, "How Reflections Ruin Exposure and Flatten Your Otherwise Great Subject"</td>', 'Or, "How Reflections Ruin Exposure and Flatten Your Otherwise Great Subject"', '2010-06-16 13:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059209, 891562, 73575, '<td valign="top">DNM... oh wait, wait, there is a boat in this bridge picture. And a lovely bridge picture it is too, I love the clouds. Would be better if the backdrop arch was centered and darkened a little; almost looks blown along the right side. Maybe crop the right 5% or so; halfway between the edge and the last pier. I actually really like the border on this, well done there.<br/> <br/>7-ish if this were a Bridge or B&amp;W challenge.</td>', 'DNM... oh wait, wait, there is a boat in this bridge picture. And a lovely bridge picture it is too, I love the clouds. Would be better if the backdrop arch was centered and darkened a little; almost looks blown along the right side. Maybe crop the right 5% or so; halfway between the edge and the last pier. I actually really like the border on this, well done there. 7-ish if this were a Bridge or B&W challenge.', '2010-06-16 13:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059211, 891768, 73575, '<td valign="top">Bumped my vote a notch for the title.</td>', 'Bumped my vote a notch for the title.', '2010-06-16 13:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059217, 890239, 73575, '<td valign="top">The abstract effect is nice; wish the boat wasn''t cut off on the edges. Also, whatever that is on the left edge is sort of distracting; wish it had been cloned out.</td>', 'The abstract effect is nice; wish the boat wasn''t cut off on the edges. Also, whatever that is on the left edge is sort of distracting; wish it had been cloned out.', '2010-06-16 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
