(6059225, 891833, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh, it took me a while to connect "gravy" with "boat". Creative idea, but the photo looks more like...well, I''m not sure what it looks like. Here''s hoping to more people connecting with your idea!</td>', 'Ohhhh, it took me a while to connect "gravy" with "boat". Creative idea, but the photo looks more like...well, I''m not sure what it looks like. Here''s hoping to more people connecting with your idea!', '2010-06-16 13:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059227, 890239, 114225, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for here, but it doesn''t really work for me. Instead of dreaminess, it just feels out of focus (sorry!).</td>', 'I see what you were going for here, but it doesn''t really work for me. Instead of dreaminess, it just feels out of focus (sorry!).', '2010-06-16 13:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059228, 891586, 73575, '<td valign="top">White is just a touch blown; the shadows under the white boats disappear at the top, and are too defined at the bottom. Doesn''t hurt it too much though.</td>', 'White is just a touch blown; the shadows under the white boats disappear at the top, and are too defined at the bottom. Doesn''t hurt it too much though.', '2010-06-16 13:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059229, 891392, 73575, '<td valign="top">Love it, love it, love it. Every detail is just right, even the name of the boat.</td>', 'Love it, love it, love it. Every detail is just right, even the name of the boat.', '2010-06-16 13:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059230, 891754, 84323, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge... the colors and composition are wonderful.  I imagine exposure must have been rather tough here with the different colors and reflectances of the objects, but you did a great job.  Maybe lighten the shadows a bit, they take away from the sea of yellow feeling.  Also, I would consider toning down the luminosity on all but the oars and the girl...she seems to blend too much into her background and the oars are already dark and moody.  I would also love to have sen her face!<br/>Do you have other shots from this series? It would be great to see them.<br/>Cheers.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge... the colors and composition are wonderful.  I imagine exposure must have been rather tough here with the different colors and reflectances of the objects, but you did a great job.  Maybe lighten the shadows a bit, they take away from the sea of yellow feeling.  Also, I would consider toning down the luminosity on all but the oars and the girl...she seems to blend too much into her background and the oars are already dark and moody.  I would also love to have sen her face!Do you have other shots from this series? It would be great to see them.Cheers.', '2010-06-16 13:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059231, 891385, 73575, '<td valign="top">E-I-E-I-Ocean.<br/> <br/>I like the lighthouse, but can''t decide if it''s a distraction or a balance.</td>', 'E-I-E-I-Ocean. I like the lighthouse, but can''t decide if it''s a distraction or a balance.', '2010-06-16 13:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059234, 891698, 84323, '<td valign="top">I like the simple toned down unsat. processing here.  I think the photo could be more effective with a tad more sharpness.  Also, the dark monotone between the grass in the forground and the grass near the water takes away from the vastness that the angle and the clouds and the open space on the left create.  Consider lighting them up a bit.  Cheers.</td>', 'I like the simple toned down unsat. processing here.  I think the photo could be more effective with a tad more sharpness.  Also, the dark monotone between the grass in the forground and the grass near the water takes away from the vastness that the angle and the clouds and the open space on the left create.  Consider lighting them up a bit.  Cheers.', '2010-06-16 13:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6059236, 890838, 117534, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT.. so peaceful and reminds me of a Norman Rockwell painting!</td>', 'LOVE IT.. so peaceful and reminds me of a Norman Rockwell painting!', '2010-06-16 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
