(6059282, 891586, 84323, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and execution of this photo.  I''m not sure I feel the idea behind it.  I can see the dynamism in the white boats, but that red boat seems static to me.  It seems he is like an island, and all the other boats are going around him like a stream, but I can''t feel the story.  But, I like the curve of the formations contrasting with the angles of the boats, and going off into the distance of the boats at the top of the frame. 6.</td>', 'I like the idea and execution of this photo.  I''m not sure I feel the idea behind it.  I can see the dynamism in the white boats, but that red boat seems static to me.  It seems he is like an island, and all the other boats are going around him like a stream, but I can''t feel the story.  But, I like the curve of the formations contrasting with the angles of the boats, and going off into the distance of the boats at the top of the frame. 6.', '2010-06-16 13:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
