(6059292, 891575, 73575, '<td valign="top">Very, very funny. Your bird must think you''re nuts.<br/> <br/>I like the lighting and shadows, gives it some drama. My only complaint is the shorts - really out of place here. Looks like there''s some air in them, probably from jumping in and out between shots... If you (or your model?) had worn cut-off jeans, especially faded, ratty ones, I''d have put this 2 points higher.</td>', 'Very, very funny. Your bird must think you''re nuts. I like the lighting and shadows, gives it some drama. My only complaint is the shorts - really out of place here. Looks like there''s some air in them, probably from jumping in and out between shots... If you (or your model?) had worn cut-off jeans, especially faded, ratty ones, I''d have put this 2 points higher.', '2010-06-16 14:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
