(6060735, 891619, 117474, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I''m trying to decide what to make of the lack of boats. <br/>I''ll decide later on.<br/> <br/>Later: While there aren''t any boats in this shot, it undeniably pertains to boats. So it fits the bill in that regard.<br/>But. At the same time if I hired someone to take a single photo of "Big boats, little boats, toy boats, dinghies, sailboats, rowboats, ocean liners, speed boats, cargo ships, cruise ships" I''d be disappointed to not see a boat in the shot. It''d definitely fit in a series called "boats". <br/>I''m quite torn. I think 7. I do like the texutre, tone and colouring.</td>', 'Great shot. I''m trying to decide what to make of the lack of boats. I''ll decide later on. Later: While there aren''t any boats in this shot, it undeniably pertains to boats. So it fits the bill in that regard.But. At the same time if I hired someone to take a single photo of "Big boats, little boats, toy boats, dinghies, sailboats, rowboats, ocean liners, speed boats, cargo ships, cruise ships" I''d be disappointed to not see a boat in the shot. It''d definitely fit in a series called "boats". I''m quite torn. I think 7. I do like the texutre, tone and colouring.', '2010-06-17 07:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
