(6061669, 891845, 103032, '<td valign="top">To me, this image feels balanced.  I like the closeness of the red boat that takes up a lot of the frame and that it is red.  This is offset by the row of sailboats in the background with the cool tones of the water, sky, and bluish tint of the sailboats.  An enjoyable photo to explore.</td>', 'To me, this image feels balanced.  I like the closeness of the red boat that takes up a lot of the frame and that it is red.  This is offset by the row of sailboats in the background with the cool tones of the water, sky, and bluish tint of the sailboats.  An enjoyable photo to explore.', '2010-06-18 08:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061670, 891675, 103032, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective under the ropes.  Very crisp.  Nice tones.</td>', 'Interesting perspective under the ropes.  Very crisp.  Nice tones.', '2010-06-18 08:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061678, 891710, 103032, '<td valign="top">Not going to vote on this because I believe I know who the photog is.  I commented on your other version which I really liked.  I actually like the other version better that was cropped tighter (the red ship on the left cropped out).  As I mentioned in the other version, I like the warmth of the dock and the various bits of color in the main subject boat.  I think your processing is wonderful in this and the other version.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'Not going to vote on this because I believe I know who the photog is.  I commented on your other version which I really liked.  I actually like the other version better that was cropped tighter (the red ship on the left cropped out).  As I mentioned in the other version, I like the warmth of the dock and the various bits of color in the main subject boat.  I think your processing is wonderful in this and the other version.  Good luck on the voting.', '2010-06-18 09:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061742, 890568, 37719, '<td valign="top">Same boat, different view...I think I like the ''foggy'' version better.</td>', 'Same boat, different view...I think I like the ''foggy'' version better.', '2010-06-18 10:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
