(6067812, 891833, 55283, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I thought for sure this was a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous</a> entry. Suits his usual approach to things. I gave it a 9, but I''m one of the folks that likes abstracts, and I also appreciated the out of the box thinking on this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Your original quote was just the sort of thing I was hoping for and was a nice way to start the week, so thank you.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: I thought for sure this was a  Posthumous entry. Suits his usual approach to things. I gave it a 9, but I''m one of the folks that likes abstracts, and I also appreciated the out of the box thinking on this.  Your original quote was just the sort of thing I was hoping for and was a nice way to start the week, so thank you.', '2010-06-23 14:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
