(6071818, 891525, 69668, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much. I do think with a bit more contrast this image would have moved up quite a bit.  Well done, great exposure and clarity.</td>', 'I like this image very much. I do think with a bit more contrast this image would have moved up quite a bit.  Well done, great exposure and clarity.', '2010-06-28 04:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6071821, 891525, 75713, '<td valign="top">I really don''t understand why your boat didn''t get any comments.  I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have given it a 6 or a 7.  It''s wonderfully done, the sea gulls following it reveal it to be a working boat and give it a strong sense of motion and tells a story.  The reflections on the water in front of the boat are an added bonus. I know getting a comment after the fact isn''t nearly as satisfying as during voting.  It truly is weird that this shot got no comments.</td>', 'I really don''t understand why your boat didn''t get any comments.  I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have given it a 6 or a 7.  It''s wonderfully done, the sea gulls following it reveal it to be a working boat and give it a strong sense of motion and tells a story.  The reflections on the water in front of the boat are an added bonus. I know getting a comment after the fact isn''t nearly as satisfying as during voting.  It truly is weird that this shot got no comments.', '2010-06-28 04:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6071838, 891525, 97225, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry that I didn''t come back and comment on this (as I fully intended to) because I really liked it and gave you 9. I like the composition, the colour, the swell of wave in the foreground and the birds add a nice embellishment.</td>', 'I''m really sorry that I didn''t come back and comment on this (as I fully intended to) because I really liked it and gave you 9. I like the composition, the colour, the swell of wave in the foreground and the birds add a nice embellishment.', '2010-06-28 04:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6071924, 891525, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the image very much. After seeing Art''s edit, I''m wondering if a closer crop would have been beneficial? The water in the foreground and left side is not nearly as interesting as the boat or it''s wake.</td>', 'I like the image very much. After seeing Art''s edit, I''m wondering if a closer crop would have been beneficial? The water in the foreground and left side is not nearly as interesting as the boat or it''s wake.', '2010-06-28 09:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6071989, 891525, 98339, '<td valign="top">I would have to agree that a closer crop and possibly a bit more contrast would have improved this a little more...but as to why no comments, I don''t know...I do know that during and after DPL I haven''t done the commenting that I had been doing prior to DPL...guess I need to get back on the stick...huh.  And to add insult to injury, I didn''t vote on this either (I''m getting over my burn out...excuses, excuses) but I''m the kind of voter that probably would have given this an 8/9 due to the "working" feel of the picture...excellent job</td>', 'I would have to agree that a closer crop and possibly a bit more contrast would have improved this a little more...but as to why no comments, I don''t know...I do know that during and after DPL I haven''t done the commenting that I had been doing prior to DPL...guess I need to get back on the stick...huh.  And to add insult to injury, I didn''t vote on this either (I''m getting over my burn out...excuses, excuses) but I''m the kind of voter that probably would have given this an 8/9 due to the "working" feel of the picture...excellent job', '2010-06-28 11:19:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6072018, 891525, 42196, '<td valign="top">lack of comments probably b/c there isn''t much going on here other than a boat in the water.<br/>nothing horrible and nothing fabulous doesn''t inspire much commenting</td>', 'lack of comments probably b/c there isn''t much going on here other than a boat in the water.nothing horrible and nothing fabulous doesn''t inspire much commenting', '2010-06-28 12:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
